sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Receptionist as Receptionist / Doctor
    participant System as Smart Hospital System (SHMS)

    Doctor->>System: submitDischargeSummary(admissionId, summaryNotes)
    activate System
    System-->>Doctor: dischargeSummarySaved(summaryId)
    deactivate System

    Receptionist->>System: finalizeDischarge(admissionId)
    activate System
    System->>System: verifyBillStatusPaid()
    System->>System: releaseAllocatedBed()
    System->>System: updateAdmissionStatusToDischarged()
    System-->>Receptionist: dischargeCompleted(status="Discharged", bedReleased=true)
    deactivate System
